{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:KnotsParticlesConfinement.CategoricalMeson","@type":"LeanModule","name":"KnotsParticlesConfinement.CategoricalMeson","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.valence_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.valence_eq","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The valence is exactly 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.valence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.valence","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Valence is 2 (quark + antiquark). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.composite","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.composite","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The meson is the composite T₀₁ · L_H · T₁₀. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.hopfBinding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.hopfBinding","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Hopf link binding L_H = σ₀σ₁. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.T10","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.T10","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Antiquark crossing pair T₁₀ = σ₁σ₀ (negative Hopf link L₋). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.T01","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.T01","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Quark crossing pair T₀₁ = σ₀σ₁ (positive Hopf link L₊). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.InvariantType","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.InvariantType","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L25-L25","doc":"The underlying type of knot invariants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson.mk","kind":"ctor","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L23-L23","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Torsion.CategoricalMeson","kind":"structure","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.lean#L19-L37","doc":"**Meson (categorical)**: a hadron of valence 2, consisting of\na quark–antiquark pair bound by the Hopf link.\nThe braid word is T₀₁ · L_H · T₁₀ = (σ₀σ₁)² · σ₁σ₀. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:categorical-meson","label":"def:categorical-meson","md":"quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/categorical-meson.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}